# the last kind: Gen (the Tone page's KNOB 1), on track 4: NEW SOUND makes it the Gen track, a
# generative stereo sound whose steps are energy. Its Sound and Tone pages turn its own knobs; a second
# Gen track is refused; it plays, its Deviance on the Track page; muted it rings out; it goes quiet a
# bar after its last step
wait 200
tap OCT+
tap OCT+
tap OCT+
expect track 3
tap ENV
tap ENV
expect view 4
spin K1 5
expect tpar6 8
expect gen -1
tapkey b10
wait 50
expect kind3 8
expect gen 3
spin K2 -10
expect tpar39 30
wait 100
shot gen-tone.png
tap ENV
expect view 3
spin K1 -20
expect tpar35 50
wait 100
shot gen-sound.png
# its low-pass: the Track FX page's third knob (the Filter share has no hits to take)
tap FX
expect view 6
spin K3 30
expect tpar42 30
spin K3 -30
expect tpar42 0
# a dense pattern of one bar, so it always plays (every hit, none fewer)
tap HOME
expect view 0
spin K1 -8
spin K2 -100
spin K3 100
expect tpar0 1
expect tpar2 0
expect tpar3 100
tapkey b9
wait 50
wav gen.wav
tap PLAY
wait 6000
expect glevel >20
# Deviance: on its Track page (EDIT, KNOB 1) as for every track
tap EDIT
expect view 2
spin K1 30
expect tpar8 70
wait 100
shot gen-track.png
# muted it rings out: there a moment after, gone in a few seconds; back when unmuted
tapkey b7
expect tpar7 1
wait 100
expect glevel >5
wait 4000
expect glevel <2
tapkey b7
expect tpar7 0
wait 3000
expect glevel >20
# a second Gen track: refused, the first plays on
tap OCT-
expect track 2
tap ENV
tap ENV
expect view 4
spin K1 6
expect tpar6 8
tapkey b10
wait 50
expect kind2 2
expect gen 3
# a drum's low-pass: the Tone page's fourth knob
spin K4 25
expect tpar42 25
wait 100
shot hat-lowpass.png
spin K4 -25
wait 100
shot gen-refused.png
# its steps cleared (GLO + EDIT twice): a bar's hold, then it fades
tap OCT+
press GLO
tap EDIT
release GLO
press GLO
tap EDIT
release GLO
wait 5000
expect glevel <2
tap PLAY
wavstop
